- [wheezes] Off to the vet.

236
00:10:13.333 --> 00:10:14.500
Yeah.

237
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.125
He'll sort you out.

238
00:10:16.208 --> 00:10:17.125
No.

239
00:10:17.625 --> 00:10:20.333
It's a one-way trip. I heard 'em talking.

240
00:10:20.416 --> 00:10:21.583
And they're right.

241
00:10:22.708 --> 00:10:24.083
I've had a great life.

242
00:10:24.166 --> 00:10:26.458
No point in a few weeks of pain.

243
00:10:27.625 --> 00:10:29.375
It's been a pleasure.

244
00:10:29.458 --> 00:10:32.333
I've… [sighs sadly]
I've heard you don't feel a thing.

245
00:10:33.458 --> 00:10:35.208
See you on the other side.

246
00:10:36.333 --> 00:10:39.000
["Hammer And Felt"
by Beneath The Mountain playing]

247
00:10:39.083 --> 00:10:40.166
See you. mate.

248
00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.000
- [cat 1] See you. old mate.
- [cat 2] See you later.

249
00:10:43.083 --> 00:10:44.708
- [Ponce] Good luck. Pete.
- [Olive] Bye.

250
00:10:44.791 --> 00:10:46.291
