- Yeah.

251
00:10:55.375 --> 00:10:59.250
Sorry. kid. Do you mind if we carry on
looking for your house tomorrow?

252
00:10:59.333 --> 00:11:01.833
I think we're all a bit gutted about Pete.

253
00:11:02.333 --> 00:11:03.875
Yeah. 'course.

254
00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.958
How old was Pete?

255
00:11:06.041 --> 00:11:07.208
Really old.

256
00:11:07.708 --> 00:11:11.041
