- Can you work that out?

260
00:11:22.708 --> 00:11:24.708
- S… Sixteen. Yeah.
- Sixteen. yeah.

261
00:11:24.791 --> 00:11:26.208
- Yeah. I was about to--
- Were you?

262
00:11:26.291 --> 00:11:27.541
- Yeah.
- [Ponce] Okay.

263
00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:30.958
- Working it out. "Can you work that out?"
- There was a bit of pause. That's all.

264
00:11:31.041 --> 00:11:34.500
- Don't you pause when you're working out?
- Sixteen minus nought.

265
00:11:34.583 --> 00:11:36.791
- You don't pause?
- Hm. what could that be?

266
00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:41.166
Just. "Oh! Let's work summat out!"
"No! Let's go straight to the answer!"

267
00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.666
Where's the working out
if you say the answer straight away?

268
00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.791
If it's minus nought.
there isn't usually a lot of working out.

269
00:11:46.875 --> 00:11:48.583
- Wow.
- Says you.

270
00:11:48.666 --> 00:11:51.250
Yeah! Says you. you fucking cunt!

271
00:11:51.333 --> 00:11:53.333
[laughing]

272
00:11:56.791 --> 00:11:58.583
