274
00:11:59.666 --> 00:12:02.375
There's always something
that fucking spoils the day. isn't there?

275
00:12:02.875 --> 00:12:07.625
We've got so few days to start with.
and they're always fucking ruined.

276
00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.041
It's tough being a cat.

277
00:12:10.833 --> 00:12:13.625
Better than being a snail though.
innit? Getting trampled on.

278
00:12:14.125 --> 00:12:16.208
- Well. yeah. A lot better.
- Yeah.

279
00:12:16.708 --> 00:12:19.458
{\an8}[Gus] Well. yeah. but I don't wanna
compare my life to a snail.

280
00:12:19.541 --> 00:12:23.000
{\an8}Of course it's fucking better.
They've got no conscience. have they?

281
00:12:23.083 --> 00:12:26.625
We fucking introspect.
so we know the pain of life.

282
00:12:26.708 --> 00:12:28.166
So we can go. "Oh. woe is me."

283
00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.916
A snail doesn't even know it's tough
'cause it doesn't know anything.

284
00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:34.625
It's a fucking bit of snot
in a fucking shell. innit? Cunt.

285
00:12:34.708 --> 00:12:36.000
You spoken to one?

286
00:12:36.083 --> 00:12:38.916
No. I haven't. There's no point
'cause they haven't got any…

287
00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.125
- They got no chat. have they?
- They got no fucking bants.

288
00:12:42.208 --> 00:12:45.291
You can go to a snail.
"All right. mate. what are you doing?"

289
00:12:45.375 --> 00:12:47.875
[babbles nonsensically]

290
00:12:47.958 --> 00:12:50.791
