- Just be careful. and pipe it down.

291
00:12:50.875 --> 00:12:52.083
- Why?
- Could be rude.

292
00:12:52.166 --> 00:12:53.166
What? Be rude?

293
00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.250
He's sticking up
for those slimy little cunts.

294
00:12:55.333 --> 00:12:56.708
- Why? Why?
- Yes. I am. actually.

295
00:12:56.791 --> 00:12:58.583
You rubbing 'em on your knob?

296
00:12:58.666 --> 00:13:01.916
I hang out with snails when I'm not
with you. and they're a nice bunch.

297
00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.458
- You hang out with snails?
- Yeah.

298
00:13:03.541 --> 00:13:05.041
