- What do you talk about?

301
00:13:10.208 --> 00:13:11.708
We just look at each other.

302
00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:14.916
You're just accompanying snails
very slowly to the slides?

303
00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.791
Do they know where they're going.
or are they going and you're following?

304
00:13:17.875 --> 00:13:19.333
Are you just observing snails?

305
00:13:19.416 --> 00:13:20.833
No. I'm taking the lead. mate.

306
00:13:20.916 --> 00:13:23.958
Fucking hell.
I'll tell you what's like a snail.

307
00:13:24.041 --> 00:13:26.958
but better and lives a lot longer.
a tortoise.

308
00:13:27.458 --> 00:13:29.416
I wonder what being a tortoise is like.

309
00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.958
- I know what fucking one's like.
- [Olive groans]

310
00:13:32.041 --> 00:13:33.458
{\an8}- [laughing]
- [Gus] Night.

311
00:13:33.541 --> 00:13:35.000
{\an8}- [Ponce] Night.
- [Olive] See you.

312
00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.041
