[Kitten] Gus.

314
00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:47.250
What?

315
00:13:47.333 --> 00:13:49.416
I definitely have to die. right?

316
00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:50.583
Yeah.

317
00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.791
I don't wanna not exist.

318
00:13:54.291 --> 00:13:55.958
I… I wanna live forever.

319
00:13:57.125 --> 00:13:58.416
Well… [sighs]

320
00:13:58.958 --> 00:14:01.000
Well. in a way. you do live forever

321
00:14:01.083 --> 00:14:06.750
because we live on
in the memories of the friends and family

322
00:14:07.458 --> 00:14:11.458
